  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Government Debt and Infrastructure Finance - The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTA intends to provide assistance to MOFEA to achieve the following objectives: Operationalization of the MOFEAs debt strategy which might include extension of the government securities maturity profile through issuance of longer-dated T-Bonds; re-profiling of the T-Bill portfolio; predictable government securities auctions; organization of market intermediaries; and improvements in government securities placement and trading and settlement procedures and infrastructure; Implementation of an appropriate organizational structure and well-defined functionalities for government debt issuance and management within the MOFEA; Enhanced MOFEA frameworks and capacity for debt strategy development; borrowing planning; fiscal risk analysis and management; portfolio risk analysis and mitigation; contingent liabilities framework; and market communication.</narrative>
  </description>
